<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of February 24 to February 28, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   623.40 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  533.57 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			  89.84 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying     104.05 billion yen</p>
</text>
